<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed three credit auctions in the secondary market on Tuesday by adding a total of 4.185 billion pesos. It placed the first credit, 1.592 billion pesos of 15-day paper, at a rate of 26.85 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE MAXIMUM MINIMUM BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.592 bln pesos  15 days  26.85   26.91   26.83   3    3</p>
<p>1.593 bln pesos   8 days  26.35   26.36   26.23   2    2</p>
<p>1.0   bln pesos   1 day   25.80   25.80   25.80   1    1</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
